## 📋 API Endpoints Principais

### Dashboard API (`/api/v2`)
```
GET  /api/v2/dashboards/{userId}          → Busca dashboard do usuário (com widgets)
GET  /api/v2/dashboard/{dashboardId}      → Busca dashboard por ID
POST /api/v2/dashboard                    → Cria novo dashboard
GET  /api/v2/widget/{widgetId}/data       → EXECUTA query do widget (LAZY LOAD)
GET  /api/v2/dashboards/{id}/widgets      → Lista widgets de um dashboard
POST /api/v2/dashboards/{id}/widgets      → Cria novo widget
```

### Menu API (Legacy)
```
GET  /api/menu-groups/{userId}            → Menus do usuário
GET  /api/menu-items/{groupId}            → Itens de um menu
```

### Autenticação
```
POST /auth/login                           → Login (ambos frontend/backend)
POST /auth/logout                          → Logout
GET  /api/user/profile                    → Perfil usuário atual
```

